1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,440
Hey, Toka! Will you let me in? Please, just hear me out.

2
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:14,280
Why don't you go talk to your little girlfriend? I have nothing more to say about it, you dummy dum-dum-dum!

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Rain. It's just like a girl. Sometimes kind. Sometimes fickle. Pouring down heavily, or not falling at all. It is the source of all life. And tonight, the rain is a little cold.

4
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:13,900
How does it even go?

5
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:27,560
Ah actually...

6
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:57,540
Thank you.

7
00:01:57,560 --> 00:02:18,820
I'll get right to the point here, Toka.

8
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:21,560
You've been really irritated lately.

9
00:02:22,300 --> 00:02:23,880
Please just tell me what's going on.

10
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:28,160
Though if I had to take a wild guess, I'd say this is about Shido and that girl.

11
00:02:28,460 --> 00:02:28,800
No.

12
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:30,420
No, you're wrong.

13
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:31,720
This has nothing to do with him.

14
00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:32,020
Oh.

15
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:34,400
I just assumed he was the cause of it.

16
00:02:37,820 --> 00:02:41,400
I don't know what's wrong.

17
00:02:41,820 --> 00:02:44,880
I'm in the worst mood ever, and I'm not even sure I know why.

18
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:57,420
Uh, Yosinon?

19
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:00,780
Wait, hold on a second.

20
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:01,900
Don't run away.

21
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,160
Oh, hey, what happened to your puppet?

22
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:08,700
Oh, I see.

23
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,360
That's what you're looking for?

24
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:15,260
Shido can do whatever he wants.

25
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:19,560
It's really none of my business who he dates or kisses or spends his free time with.

26
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:21,560
But when I saw that, it just...

27
00:03:22,460 --> 00:03:24,120
I felt awful all of a sudden.

28
00:03:24,740 --> 00:03:28,580
Then when I heard the rabbit say Shido cared more about that other girl than me,

29
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:31,080
it was like I was empty inside.

30
00:03:31,460 --> 00:03:32,620
Like I was all alone.

31
00:03:33,660 --> 00:03:34,080
Sad.

32
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:36,500
That's what it made me feel more than anything else.

33
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:37,380
Scared, too.

34
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:40,640
I'm really worried there might be something wrong with me.

35
00:03:42,940 --> 00:03:43,340
Gotcha.

36
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:47,240
So you lost it while you were fighting the AST yesterday?

37
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,780
Kotri, do you copy that?

38
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:52,940
Yeah, we're analyzing the video now.

39
00:03:53,460 --> 00:03:56,300
You take the lead on the search, and we'll support you as much as we can.

40
00:03:56,500 --> 00:03:58,160
But we're gonna take a back seat on this one.

41
00:03:58,600 --> 00:04:00,660
It'll be better if all her attention is on you.

42
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:04,680
Yoshinon, we're ready to start whenever you are.

43
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:08,060
Oh, see, the thing is, my name is...

44
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:09,200
It's not Yoshinon.

45
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:13,160
It's Yoshinon, and Yoshinon is the puppet we're looking for.

46
00:04:13,700 --> 00:04:14,680
And my friend...

47
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:17,240
Yoshinon, I gotcha.

48
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:19,940
Wait a sec.

49
00:04:22,320 --> 00:04:23,520
Please, take it.

50
00:04:23,580 --> 00:04:25,860
You could catch a bad cold in a rainstorm like this.

51
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:31,900
Oh, don't worry.

52
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:32,700
I'll be all right.

53
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,560
Really, I want you to have it.

54
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:41,160
Mom, that's very kind of you.

55
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:41,960
Sure.

56
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:44,620
There is absolutely nothing wrong with you.

57
00:04:45,020 --> 00:04:48,280
But listen, I think we should definitely clear a few things up.

58
00:04:48,540 --> 00:04:49,260
Like what?

59
00:04:49,500 --> 00:04:52,340
Well, you should know that kiss was an accident.

60
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:53,160
Completely.

61
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:58,240
And it's not remotely true that Shido cares more about that other girl than he does about you.

62
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:00,680
Yes, but Shido was...

63
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,160
Just think about it.

64
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,680
He risked his life to save you.

65
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:08,100
Do you seriously believe he would have put himself in danger like that if he didn't care one bit?

66
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:09,740
Watch out!

67
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:16,520
You know, Shido, are you hungry?

68
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:29,760
Why don't you two take a break and get something to eat?

69
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:32,240
Might give you a chance to ask her some questions.

70
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,740
Yeah, good call.

71
00:05:33,740 --> 00:05:37,520
But it looks like the fighting put these restaurants out of commission.

72
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:38,720
Let's go to my house.

73
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,920
We can eat there.

74
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:44,340
You sure love that puppet, don't you?

75
00:05:44,340 --> 00:05:46,840
Most people would just give up and go buy a new one.

76
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:48,840
Yeah, she must be really important to you, huh?

77
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:51,260
She is.

78
00:05:51,260 --> 00:05:52,260
Yes.

79
00:05:52,260 --> 00:05:53,260
Yoshinan is my friend.

80
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:54,260
My best friend.

81
00:05:54,260 --> 00:05:56,260
And she's my hero, too.

82
00:05:56,260 --> 00:05:57,260
Your hero?

83
00:05:57,260 --> 00:05:58,260
Oh, yes.

84
00:05:58,260 --> 00:05:59,260
See?

85
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:01,260
Yoshinan is the greatest.

86
00:06:01,260 --> 00:06:02,260
She's who I want to be.

87
00:06:02,260 --> 00:06:03,260
She's just so brave.

88
00:06:03,260 --> 00:06:04,260
So strong.

89
00:06:04,260 --> 00:06:05,260
She's not pathetic like I am.

90
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:06,260
If I could be more like her, I would be so happy.

91
00:06:06,260 --> 00:06:07,260
But I'm not.

92
00:06:07,260 --> 00:06:08,260
And I'll never be.

93
00:06:08,260 --> 00:06:09,260
Well, I don't know about all that.

94
00:06:09,260 --> 00:06:12,260
As a matter of fact, I like you just the way you are.

95
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:13,260
Hey.

96
00:06:13,260 --> 00:06:14,260
Something wrong?

97
00:06:14,260 --> 00:06:15,260
Oh, well.

98
00:06:15,260 --> 00:06:16,260
