115
00:06:53,260 --> 00:06:56,260
Any creature that feels has to despise them.

116
00:06:56,260 --> 00:06:57,260
Don't you think so?

117
00:06:57,260 --> 00:06:58,260
Yeah, maybe.

118
00:06:58,260 --> 00:06:59,260
One would hope.

119
00:06:59,260 --> 00:07:01,260
Then again, I'm just a big scaredy cat.

120
00:07:01,260 --> 00:07:03,260
When I'm scared, I freeze them.

121
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:07,260
I can't think, or move, or speak.

122
00:07:07,260 --> 00:07:08,260
I'm so afraid.

123
00:07:08,260 --> 00:07:10,260
It's like I can't do anything at all.

124
00:07:10,260 --> 00:07:13,260
Except stand there, hoping someone will save me.

125
00:07:13,260 --> 00:07:14,260
It's awful.

126
00:07:14,260 --> 00:07:18,260
If I wasn't such a coward, I might be able to fight back.

127
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:19,260
But I am.

128
00:07:19,260 --> 00:07:21,260
Always have been.

129
00:07:21,260 --> 00:07:24,260
The truth is, I'm nothing like Yoshinan.

130
00:07:24,260 --> 00:07:27,260
When I'm in danger, she's right there by my side.

131
00:07:27,260 --> 00:07:28,260
Always.

132
00:07:28,260 --> 00:07:31,260
She gives me the courage I don't have on my own.

133
00:07:31,260 --> 00:07:34,260
She's strong, brave, and fearless.

134
00:07:34,260 --> 00:07:35,260
She's my hero.

135
00:07:35,260 --> 00:07:36,260
So you see?

136
00:07:36,260 --> 00:07:37,260
That's it.

137
00:07:37,260 --> 00:07:39,260
That's why I won't fight.

138
00:07:39,260 --> 00:07:43,260
