139
00:07:43,260 --> 00:07:44,260
Come on.

140
00:07:44,260 --> 00:07:46,260
I'm here to protect you.

141
00:07:46,260 --> 00:07:49,260
And I'll make sure we find Yoshinan.

142
00:07:49,260 --> 00:07:53,260
But you don't have to rely on her to protect you anymore.

143
00:07:53,260 --> 00:07:55,260
Cause I'm gonna be your hero now.

144
00:07:55,260 --> 00:07:57,260
That's right.

145
00:07:57,260 --> 00:08:00,260
It doesn't matter if she's a spirit.

146
00:08:00,260 --> 00:08:03,260
A girl as kind as she is deserves nothing less.

147
00:08:03,260 --> 00:08:06,260
