148
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:07,260
Sure.

149
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:10,260
So, look.

150
00:08:10,260 --> 00:08:12,260
I'm sorry about what happened.

151
00:08:12,260 --> 00:08:14,260
