153
00:08:15,260 --> 00:08:16,260
Yeah.

154
00:08:16,260 --> 00:08:17,260
You know.

155
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:21,260
A kiss is when you get really close and touch each other's lips.

156
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:22,260
Just like this.

157
00:08:22,260 --> 00:08:24,260
Shino, I'm so sorry that I...

158
00:08:27,260 --> 00:08:46,260
Shino, sorry to bother you at a time like this, but we figured out where Yoshinan is.

159
00:08:46,260 --> 00:08:47,260
Great.

160
00:08:47,260 --> 00:08:48,260
Awesome work.

161
00:08:48,260 --> 00:08:49,260
